          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 412.65999999999997,
          "end": 415.56,
          "en": "we have game is over, which is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 415.56,
          "end": 417.88,
          "en": "And we have a userNumber which is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 417.88,
          "end": 420.64,
          "en": "And therefor, we show the over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 420.64,
          "end": 422.97,
          "en": "To avoid this, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 422.97,
          "end": 427.68,
          "en": "that we also set game is over to false once we start a game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 427.68,
          "end": 430.65,
          "en": "So here, when we pick a number, we also wanna set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 430.65,
          "end": 434.94,
          "en": "game is over to false to indicate that the game started now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 434.94,
          "end": 437.033,
          "en": "and that it's, therefore, not over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 437.033,
          "end": 438.53,
          "en": "This is important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 438.53,
          "end": 441.12,
          "en": "And these two state updates will be batched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 441.12,
          "end": 443.71,
          "en": "together by React, so that the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 443.71,
          "end": 446.37,
          "en": "is not rerendered twice, but only once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 446.37,
          "end": 449.2,
          "en": "That's just a side note and that's just React specific,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 449.2,
          "end": 453.35,
          "en": "has nothing to do with React native, but is nice to know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 453.35,
          "end": 455.063,
          "en": "So now finally with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 455.96,
          "end": 458.24,
          "en": "we should be able to enter a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 458.24,
          "end": 460.5,
          "en": "Now the game is starting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 460.5,
          "end": 464.21,
          "en": "And now we can and try to guess this number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 464.21,
          "end": 467.21,
          "en": "or let the phone guess this number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 467.21,
          "end": 468.62,
          "en": "And we still get this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 468.62,
          "end": 471.5,
          "en": "maximum call stack size exceeded error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 471.5,
          "end": 474.57,
          "en": "as soon as we reach the final number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 474.57,
          "end": 477.3,
          "en": "So let's see why this is happening now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 477.3,
          "end": 481.21,
          "en": "This error is occurring because of this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 481.21,
          "end": 482.91,
          "en": "in the game screen component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 482.91,
          "end": 485.213,
          "en": "where we generate our initial guess.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 486.18,
          "end": 489.04,
          "en": "What's important to understand about this code snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 489.04,
          "end": 492.27,
          "en": "is that this function will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 492.27,
          "end": 496.07,
          "en": "whenever the game screen component is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 496.07,
          "end": 499.48,
          "en": "So whenever it is reevaluated, which will be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 499.48,
          "end": 501.533,
          "en": "whenever a new guess is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 502.4,
          "end": 504.36,
          "en": "So therefore regenerate it a new random number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 504.36,
          "end": 505.58,
          "en": "whenever that happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 505.58,
          "end": 508.79,
          "en": "and we take our current min and max boundaries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 508.79,
          "end": 510.47,
          "en": "into account here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 510.47,
          "end": 515.47,
          "en": "The problem with that just is that if we do it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 515.68,
          "end": 519.22,
          "en": "we execute this function, even at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 519.22,
          "end": 522.85,
          "en": "where min boundary and max boundary are the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 522.85,
          "end": 525.283,
          "en": "because we derived our final result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 526.12,
          "end": 528.62,
          "en": "Now we don't do this in the next guess handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 528.62,
          "end": 531.55,
          "en": "because this handler can't be executed anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 531.55,
          "end": 533.66,
          "en": "as soon as we have the final result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 533.66,
          "end": 536.05,
          "en": "because the buttons won't be shown anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 536.05,
          "end": 538.84,
          "en": "because we move to that game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 538.84,
          "end": 543.29,
          "en": "But the problem is that this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 543.29,
          "end": 546.78,
          "en": "is rerendered one time where the current guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 546.78,
          "end": 548.965,
          "en": "is equal to the userNumber.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 548.965,
          "end": 552.65,
          "en": "Now useEffect runs after this rerendered cycle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 552.65,
          "end": 554.74,
          "en": "Hence we only trigger this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 554.74,
          "end": 556.78,
          "en": "that moves to the game over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 556.78,
          "end": 559.493,
          "en": "after this component has been executed once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 560.36,
          "end": 563.17,
          "en": "Now, this is early enough to avoid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 563.17,
          "end": 566.15,
          "en": "that the user is able to press these buttons again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 566.15,
          "end": 569.42,
          "en": "because the latest buttons won't have rendered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 569.42,
          "end": 572.83,
          "en": "The buttons with the updated state won't have rendered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 572.83,
          "end": 575.2,
          "en": "But this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 575.2,
          "end": 578.72,
          "en": "this will execute before useEffect is evaluated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 578.72,
          "end": 581.663,
          "en": "so before we can move on to the game over state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 582.7,
          "end": 585.36,
          "en": "The work around is to hard code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 585.36,
          "end": 588.84,
          "en": "our default min and max values here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 588.84,
          "end": 591.2,
          "en": "Because we only need this once, anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 591.2,
          "end": 593.47,
          "en": "we only need this initially, anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 593.47,
          "end": 596.35,
          "en": "and thereafter, we don't care about this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 596.35,
          "end": 600.13,
          "en": "An alternative solution could be to use the useMemo hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 600.13,
          "end": 604.93,
          "en": "provided by React to avoid that this gets executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 604.93,
          "end": 607.02,
          "en": "This might be a great alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 607.02,
          "end": 609.52,
          "en": "but this is a quick and simple workaround",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 609.52,
          "end": 611.023,
          "en": "that also does the trick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 612.17,
          "end": 615.633,
          "en": "And with that changed, if we now reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 616.62,
          "end": 621.62,
          "en": "we are able to play this game again, but now you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 622.83,
          "end": 624.49,
          "en": "that we move to the game over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 624.49,
          "end": 628.95,
          "en": "as soon as we reach that number, 31 in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 628.95,
          "end": 631.45,
          "en": "So now we got rid of this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 631.45,
          "end": 634.27,
          "en": "by hard coding these values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 634.27,
          "end": 636.01,
          "en": "And it's really important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 636.01,
          "end": 639.8,
          "en": "that we had this problem because useEffect technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 639.8,
          "end": 643.72,
          "en": "runs after the component function has been executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 643.72,
          "end": 647.29,
          "en": "And, therefore, this executed with the equal min and max",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 647.29,
          "end": 649.46,
          "en": "boundaries at a point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 649.46,
          "end": 652.14,
          "en": "where it shouldn't have executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 652.14,
          "end": 656.19,
          "en": "Now this works, and now we can come back to styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 656.19,
          "end": 658.15,
          "en": "and work on this game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 658.15,
          "end": 661.57,
          "en": "But also, of course, optimize is all these other screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 661.57,
          "end": 665.09,
          "en": "And as always, definitely feel free to do this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 665.09,
          "end": 667.46,
          "en": "Come up with your own layout and your own styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 667.46,
          "end": 670.343,
          "en": "And then see what I will do in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
